PostgreSQL counter samples and the report for the throughput bench

Usage: wamn-throughput <COMMAND>

Commands:
  sample  Read pg_stat_database and pg_stat_activity (and NATS /varz) once
  report  Reduce a sweep's evidence directory to tables, a knee and a peak per layer
  schema  Print the index document's JSON Schema (what schema/wamn-throughput.schema.json holds)
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help
